00:06:01.894 --> 00:06:03.395
When the cops come to arrest
him, he says,

00:06:03.395 --> 00:06:07.399
[ Chuckling ]
"Guys, that was only yesterday.

00:06:07.399 --> 00:06:09.835
Let's move on."

00:06:09.835 --> 00:06:13.105
Also stop telling people there's
a light at the end of the tunnel

00:06:13.105 --> 00:06:14.974
before there is actually a light
at the end of the tunnel.

00:06:14.974 --> 00:06:17.443
No one who actually knows
anything about this

00:06:17.443 --> 00:06:20.078
says we are going back to normal
until there is a vaccine,

00:06:20.078 --> 00:06:22.515
which takes at least
a year to 18 months.

00:06:22.515 --> 00:06:24.884
Just listen to
Dr. Anthony Fauci.

00:06:24.884 --> 00:06:26.352
-When you gradually come back,

00:06:26.352 --> 00:06:28.621
you don't jump into it
with both feet.

00:06:28.621 --> 00:06:29.989
You say, you know,
what are the that things

00:06:29.989 --> 00:06:32.758
that you can still do
and still approach normal?

00:06:32.758 --> 00:06:36.395
One of them is absolute
compulsive hand washing.

00:06:36.395 --> 00:06:39.932
The other one is you don't
ever shake anybody's hands.

00:06:39.932 --> 00:06:41.767
[ Chuckles ] That's clear.

00:06:41.767 --> 00:06:44.403
The other thing,
depending upon your status,

00:06:44.403 --> 00:06:48.874
the possibility that when
are you in a group of people,

00:06:48.874 --> 00:06:52.544
that you can't avoid
