out of 10 feet,

00:06:54.347 --> 00:06:57.016
that you might want to wear
a cloth face protection.

00:06:57.016 --> 00:07:00.619
-The toughest part about that --

00:07:00.619 --> 00:07:02.288
Son of a bitch.

00:07:02.288 --> 00:07:06.759
Is there a second
"Thorn Birds" now?

00:07:06.759 --> 00:07:09.928
What in the world?

00:07:09.928 --> 00:07:12.664
Sorry. The toughest part of
that advice for Donald Trump

00:07:12.664 --> 00:07:14.033
is the no handshakes rule.

00:07:14.033 --> 00:07:16.235
Because as we've seen from
