00:07:34.987 --> 00:07:38.424
I guess we have to be
best friends for life.

00:07:38.424 --> 00:07:42.829
So tell me,
do you really eat snails?

00:07:42.829 --> 00:07:45.230
[ Normal voice ] And then there
is the advice about masks.

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:47.866
Now we know Trump does not
