00:07:56.675 --> 00:07:58.977
And Trump certainly doesn't
listen to actual doctors.

00:07:58.977 --> 00:08:01.380
Instead, he listens to TV idiots
like Sean Hannity.

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:03.216
At one point, Trump admitted
he got his information

00:08:03.216 --> 00:08:04.983
