00:08:19.098 --> 00:08:22.168
-I would, based on all I know,
Dr. Hannity --

00:08:22.168 --> 00:08:24.570
Dr. Hannity,
I'm my only patient.

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:27.039
I would absolutely use it
if I got this.

00:08:27.039 --> 00:08:29.241
-Ugh. People always
get this wrong.

00:08:29.241 --> 00:08:33.212
You're not Dr. Hannity,
you're Dr. Hannity's Monster.

00:08:37.749 --> 00:08:39.084
I'm sorry.

00:08:39.084 --> 00:08:41.386
You are not qualified to give
anyone medical advice.

00:08:41.386 --> 00:08:43.655
You look like you've only ever
had one medical procedure,

00:08:43.655 --> 00:08:45.424
