00:09:10.115 --> 00:09:11.784
So it's voluntary.
You don't have to do it.

00:09:11.784 --> 00:09:14.519
They suggested it
for a period of time.

00:09:14.519 --> 00:09:18.090
But this is voluntary.

00:09:18.090 --> 00:09:20.325
I don't think
