00:09:41.780 --> 00:09:43.716
For a while, anyway.
I don't want to get tied down.

00:09:43.716 --> 00:09:45.251
You know what?
We should see other people.

00:09:45.251 --> 00:09:47.386
Or at least, I should
see other people.

00:09:47.386 --> 00:09:49.121
You are welcome to stay
faithful to me.

00:09:49.121 --> 00:09:51.990
The CDC even recommends it.

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:54.059
[ Normal voice ] And not only
does Trump ignore doctors,

00:09:54.059 --> 00:09:56.361
